From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:36:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] power: regulator: qcom-rpmh: add PM8350

